WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Crouching heavy punch begins the route.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.700
The first cancel Rush links back heavy punch to standing medium kick.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.300
The second cancel Rush spends the remaining Drive and enters burnout.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:03.900
Crouching heavy punch continues after the second Rush.

5
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:04.250
Standing light kick links into the heavy special.

6
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.600
Heavy Tomahawk Buster ends the route.

7
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.200
Ryu falls while Lily remains in burnout.
